# Context hygiene

Do not read or search generated trees unless the user asks: `target/`, `.anchor/`, `test-ledger/`, `node_modules/`, `.sp1/`, `sp1-artifacts/`, `*.so` / `*.elf` / `*.proof`.

Prefer: `program/src`, `zk-circuit/guest`, `zk-circuit/host`, `roadmap.md`, `further_explanations/`, `AGENTS.md`.

`.cursorignore` lists the same folders — keep it in sync if you add new artifact dirs.
